      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s six lakes were engineered between 1960 and 1965, with the first originally meant to supply water to a farmer’s cattle.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shamrock_Lakes%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lakefront is the central landmark, while Shamrock Lakes Park offers well‑maintained paths, a small amphitheater, and mature oak trees.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://poi-travel.de/us/city/180-Shamrock+Lakes-Blackford-Indiana.html",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1973, Shamrock Lakes became the first Indiana community to incorporate in fifty years, marking a milestone in local governance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shamrock_Lakes%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town’s website invites newcomers and residents alike to enjoy life together, offering updates on board meetings and homes for sale.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26,
